"On, bars count up as quota is used; off, they count down to what's left. The color always warns as quota runs low." = "開啟時長條隨用量往上累加，關閉時則往下遞減顯示剩餘。無論何者，額度偏低時顏色都會提出警示。";
"The deficit/reserve marker. Historical learns each quota window's usage pattern; during learning, the Linear estimate is labeled; Linear uses the exact reset duration; Off hides the marker." = "超前／保留量的標記。歷史模式會學習每個額度時間窗的使用模式，學習期間會標示為線性估算；線性模式使用確切的重置週期；關閉則隱藏標記。";
"Hides only that client's quota card here and on its own tab — the tab and its cost/token data stay visible. Useful for accounts with no OAuth quota (e.g. Claude Console). Grayed out when the tab itself is hidden below, since a hidden tab always hides its quota card too." = "只隱藏該用戶端在此處與自身分頁的額度卡片 —— 分頁本身與費用／token 資料仍會顯示。適合沒有 OAuth 額度的帳號（例如 Claude Console）。當下方把該分頁整個隱藏時，這裡會變成灰色，因為隱藏分頁一定連帶隱藏它的額度卡片。";
"Off removes a tab from the popover's tab row. Cost/token data is unaffected." = "關閉會將該分頁從彈出視窗的分頁列移除。費用與 token 資料不受影響。";
"Drag to set the order used by both the top tabs and the quota cards — or drag a tab directly in the top bar. The switch shows/hides a client's top tab (hiding also drops its quota card)." = "拖曳可設定頂端分頁與額度卡片共用的排序，也可以直接在頂端分頁列上拖曳分頁。開關用來顯示或隱藏該用戶端的頂端分頁（隱藏時也會一併移除它的額度卡片）。";
"Present clients have a switch to show/hide their top tab — hiding also removes that client's quota card. Quota-only clients (OAuth quota, no local sessions, e.g. Antigravity) have no tab, so they appear here only to order their quota card. Drag order applies to both top tabs and quota cards." = "有本機資料的用戶端會有開關可顯示或隱藏頂端分頁 —— 隱藏時也會移除該用戶端的額度卡片。純額度用戶端（只有 OAuth 額度、沒有本機工作階段，例如 Antigravity）沒有分頁，出現在這裡只是為了排序它的額度卡片。拖曳排序會同時套用到頂端分頁與額度卡片。";
"Affects the live-session card only: on, each agent & model gets its own row; off, rows collapse to one per app." = "只影響即時工作階段卡片：開啟時每個 Agent 與模型各佔一列，關閉時每個應用程式合併為一列。";
"Or drag the handle at the bottom edge of the popover. Width is fixed; \"Auto\" fits about 60% of your screen height." = "也可以拖曳彈出視窗底部邊緣的把手。寬度固定；「自動」約為螢幕高度的 60%。";
"How often the tray re-reads your logs. The dashboard refreshes when the popover opens; live tokens/min updates every few seconds regardless." = "選單列重新讀取記錄檔的頻率。儀表板會在開啟彈出視窗時更新；即時的每分鐘 tokens 則不受此設定影響，每隔幾秒就會更新。";
"TokenBar began as a fork of tokcat by handlecusion. Parsing & pricing come from tokscale by Junho Yeo; the menu-bar patterns reference CodexBar by Peter Steinberger; the running cat traces back to RunCat by Takuto Nakamura. MIT licensed." = "TokenBar 最初是 handlecusion 的 tokcat 分支。解析與計價來自 Junho Yeo 的 tokscale；選單列的做法參考 Peter Steinberger 的 CodexBar；跑動的貓則源自 Takuto Nakamura 的 RunCat。採用 MIT 授權。";
"For a second Claude account, run it with CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR pointed at an isolated folder, then add that folder here. Its usage is merged into the totals above everywhere in TokenBar — there is no separate per-account view." = "第二個 Claude 帳號請以 CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR 指向隔離資料夾來執行，再把該資料夾加到這裡。它的用量會合併進上方的總計 —— TokenBar 各處都不會分開顯示個別帳號。";
"%lld of %lld path(s) can't be read right now — this is retried automatically on the next scan." = "%2$lld 個路徑中有 %1$lld 個目前無法讀取 —— 下次掃描時會自動重試。";
